				6103.46630859375
			],
			"widgets_values":[
				"subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the young woman from <Picture 1>, with long black hair styled in an elaborate high bun adorned with gold floral hairpins and dangling jade earrings, wearing a red Hanfu robe with pale-gold floral embroidery and a sheer beige outer sleeve.\n<Subject 2> is the young man from <Picture 2>, with long black hair tied in a topknot secured by a pale jade hair ornament, wearing a slate-blue Hanfu robe with dark embroidered collar trim, a wide dark belt with an ornate metal buckle, and a sheathed sword at his hip.\n<Subject 3> is the traditional Chinese courtyard from <Picture 3>, featuring white plaster walls with dark tiled roofs, a circular moon gate, gray stone-paved ground, a round stone table with drum-shaped stools, pine trees, bamboo, moss-covered rocks, and a small koi pond catching morning light.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The target video is a 15-second, 16:9 cinematic ancient-Chinese romance scene in which <Subject 1> and <Subject 2> sit together at the stone table in <Subject 3> and talk about her mother's opposition to their relationship. The video opens directly on their conversation with no establishing delay; the young man comforts her, vows his devotion, and finally kisses her. The sequence uses four shots with camera movement and emotional music.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved - her high bun with gold floral hairpins, jade earrings, red floral Hanfu, and sheer beige sleeves are retained.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved - his topknot with jade hair ornament, slate-blue Hanfu, dark embroidered collar, belt with metal buckle, and sheathed sword are retained.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved - the white walls, dark tile roofs, moon gate, stone table and stools, pine trees, bamboo, moss rocks, and koi pond are retained.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is cinematic, live-action, 16:9 horizontal framing, with soft natural morning light and a warm, slightly desaturated ancient-Chinese palette.\n[Shot 1] The video opens directly on a medium two-shot at the round stone table in <Subject 3>, the courtyard's moon gate, pine branches, and koi pond softly blurred behind them; <Subject 1> in the red floral Hanfu and <Subject 2> in the slate-blue Hanfu sit face to face, already mid-conversation. The camera pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed as the young woman with a soft, trembling voice (S1) says: <d>[Chinese] 我母亲知道了我们的事，她说……不许我再与你往来。</d> She lowers her gaze to the stone table. The young man (S2) leans forward slightly and asks quietly: <d>[Chinese] 那你，是怎么想的？</d>\n[Shot 2] At 00:04.000, the shot cuts to a medium close-up of <Subject 1> from a three-quarter angle, her figure at the left third of the wide frame with the pine branches and pond softly blurred behind her. Her fingers tighten on the edge of the stone table as she says: <d>[Chinese] 她说你佩剑走江湖，配不上我们书香门第……可我心里，始终放不下你。</d> A jade earring sways as she turns her face away.\n[Shot 3] At 00:08.000, the shot cuts to a medium close-up of <Subject 2> at the right third of the frame, his jade hair ornament catching the morning light. The camera arcs slowly clockwise with small amplitude around him as he reaches across the table and takes her hands in his. The young man with a calm, low voice (S2) says: <d>[Chinese] 待我登门提亲，向伯母证明真心。无论谁阻拦，我心意不变。</d> He lifts one hand to brush a stray strand of hair from her cheek, his eyes never leaving hers.\n[Shot 4] At 00:12.000, the shot cuts to a close-up two-shot across the table, their faces filling the horizontal frame from left to right, her gold hairpins and his jade hair ornament both glinting. The camera pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed as <Subject 2> leans closer, <Subject 1> closes her eyes, and they share a slow, tender kiss. A few petals drift down from the pine tree above them. The camera holds the moment as they slowly part, foreheads still touching, while warm light spreads across the courtyard stones.\n\noverall_soundscape: Soft morning courtyard ambience continues throughout, with distant birdsong, light wind in the pine and bamboo, and the gentle splash of koi in the small pond. Fabric rustles as the two characters move, and the stone table receives a faint tap from her fingertips before their hands clasp.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: A solo guzheng introduces a slow, melancholic melody, joined by erhu and soft strings as the conversation turns emotional, then swelling into a warm, romantic phrase with bamboo flute and light percussion during the kiss before gently fading.\n",
